      "name": "[Norma] En-Nah Frontline",
      "desc": "When Norma unleashes a <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter</color>, she gains 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Combo</color>, causing her DMG to ignore 6% of the target's <color=#FF5521>Fire RES</color>, stacking up to 5 times. When Norma is hit, she loses 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>Combo</color>, with a maximum loss of 1 stack every 5s. Norma's <color=#FFFFFF>Dash Attack</color> can trigger <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color>.",
